    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Perched proudly on the hilltop of the highly sought-after Ardbrack area of Kinsale, Muldron is a charming detached three-bedroomed bungalow situated on an elevated 0.54 acre site. The property enjoys spectacular, uninterrupted views over Kinsale Harbour, taking in Charles Fort, James Fort and the marina in the inner harbour.\n\n\nExtending to approximately 115 sq m (1,240 sq ft) the bungalow accommodation comprises two spacious double bedrooms, a third single bedroom/study, a living room, a kitchen/dining room, separate wc and family bathroom. A sizeable garage to the rear provides valuable storage and workshop space.\nThe elevated nature of the site ensures the property commands spectacular views and a southerly aspect results in fantastic light and sunshine throughout the day. The location is equally appealing, just a short stroll from Summercove village with it`s Bulman Pub, historical Charles Fort and coastal walks and Kinsale town with all it has to offer being equidistant. \n\n\nThe property will benefit from modernisation and upgrading and offers a rare opportunity in this prime residential location. It`s position, within easy reach of Kinsale town centre and its many amenities, Muldron combines a highly sought after address with exceptional views over one of Ireland`s most picturesque harbours. The site size, being just over 0.5 acres offers great scope for redevelopment with plenty of room for extending the current foot print and garden space to take full advantage of this stunning spot. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Elevated property with uninterrupted views over Kinsale Harbour </li><li> Views towards Charles Fort, James Fort and the surrounding coastline </li><li> Detached 3-bedroomed bungalow extending to approximately 115 sq. m. (1,238 sq. ft.) </li><li> Large garage to the rear offering excellent storage or workshop space </li><li> Prime Ardbrack location within easy reach of Kinsale town centre and local amenities</li></ul>"
      },
